OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA bright start for many,
OL,6,Falthough fog patches may linger in
OL,7,Fprone locations at first. Turning
OL,8,Fslightly cloudier from the northeast
OL,9,Finto the afternoon yet still with
OL,10,Fplenty of sunny spells on offer.
OL,11,FFeeling cooler than yesterday.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FClear spells allow
OL,14,Ftemperatures to drop off tonight, with
OL,15,Fsome mist and fog patches developing
OL,16,Fin prone locations under light winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
