OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CTuesday:FAgain, a bright start for
OL,6,Fmany, leading into patchy clouds and
OL,7,Fsunny spells through Tuesday. Feeling
OL,8,Fsimilar to yesterday, with around
OL,9,Faverage temperatures.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:
OL,12,FVariable cloud with sunny spells over
OL,13,Fthe next few days with light showers
OL,14,Fwhere the cloud thickens. Winds
OL,15,Fstrengthening through Wednesday, with
OL,16,Fstronger gusts along southern
OL,17,Fcoastlines.
